WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.268
♪♪

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:03.536
<i> I play horror games
 a lot.</i>

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:05.204
<i> This show is basically
 taking that</i>

00:00:05.237 --> 00:00:06.572
to the next level

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:08.107
and putting me
in the games.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.041
Where are we going?

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:10.676
I don't know why 
I signed up for this,

00:00:10.709 --> 00:00:11.811
to be honest.
[laughs]

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:16.549
♪♪

00:00:16.582 --> 00:00:17.750
<i> Really impressed by
 the scope</i>

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:18.551
<i> of the whole thing.</i>

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:20.386
Usually, it's just me
in a room

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:22.355
with one camera,
and that's it.

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:24.290
<i> Now, there was, like,
 three cameras at me</i>

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:24.757
<i> at all times</i>

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:25.825
<i> and producers</i>

00:00:25.858 --> 00:00:27.360
and all that kind
of stuff

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:28.261
I'm not used to.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:29.595
So, alright, guys,
so tech rehearsal's

00:00:29.628 --> 00:00:30.629
at 5 o'clock.

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:31.831
PEWDIEPIE:<i> I literally just
 had to show up</i>

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:33.366
<i> and everything was
 set up.</i>

00:00:33.399 --> 00:00:35.068
It was so much fun.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:35.635
It's, like,
this whole thing

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:36.536
set up for me.

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:37.470
Yes!

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:38.505
<i> I was super-impressed
 by all the sets.</i>

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:41.407
<i> It really felt like
 I was in a video game.</i>

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.441
[Bleep]

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:45.511
<i> Obviously, I knew what
 I was getting into.</i>

00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:46.779
<i> I knew I was set out
 to be scared.</i>

00:00:46.812 --> 00:00:47.847
[screams]

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.116
<i> But they never told me
 anything about the show.</i>

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.651
<i> I never knew what
 was gonna go on.</i>

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:53.586
I was supposed to do,
like,

00:00:53.619 --> 00:00:54.520
a health check-up

00:00:54.553 --> 00:00:55.321
before the show,

00:00:55.354 --> 00:00:56.856
an insurance thing,
they told me

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:57.523
that it was.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.092
<i> And then, all of a sudden,</i>

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.461
<i> I'm sitting there
 in a hospital</i>

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:03.362
<i> and all these
 insane thing happen.</i>

00:01:03.395 --> 00:01:05.431
[growling]

00:01:05.464 --> 00:01:06.599
But my health is fine.

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:08.801
You all did
an amazing job,

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:09.735
obviously.

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:12.271
I think you succeeded
scaring PewDiePie.

00:01:12.304 --> 00:01:14.073 line:7%
[clapping]

00:01:12.304 --> 00:01:14.073
<i> I really did have
 the time of my life</i>

00:01:14.106 --> 00:01:15.141
and I'm so glad
I did it

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:16.676
'cause it was just
super-cool.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:17.477
That's it, folks.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.378
I can't wait for you
to see this.

00:01:19.411 --> 00:01:20.379
It's gonna be awesome.

00:01:20.412 --> 00:01:24.117
♪♪

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.385
I still don't fully
trust that

00:01:26.418 --> 00:01:27.252
it's over.

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:28.588
People just set cameras
in front of me,

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:29.489
I'm never safe.

00:01:29.522 --> 00:01:31.357
♪♪

